{"title": "Magic Initiate: Bard", "pageid": 20442, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Magic_Initiate_Bard.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Magic_Initiate_Bard.webp/300px-Magic_Initiate_Bard.webp, /w/images/b/b3/Magic_Initiate_Bard.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Magic_Initiate_Bard.webp/300px-Magic_Initiate_Bard.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Magic_Initiate_Bard.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Magic Initiate: Bard</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. It grants you spells and cantrips from that particular class.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have learnt 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Cantrip\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cantrip\">cantrips</a> and a Level 1 spell from the <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Bard_spells\" title=\"List of Bard spells\">Bard spell list</a>. \n</p><p>You can cast the Level 1 spell once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. Your <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcasting_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spellcasting Modifier\">Spellcasting Modifier</a> for all 3 spells is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/38px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/50px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Bard_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Bard (Feat)\">Magic Initiate: Bard (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195611\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 648/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3614/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2121/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 694865/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.488      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.488      1 -total\n 34.71%    9.540      1 Template:Ability\n 33.26%    9.143      1 Template:Icon_link\n 32.07%    8.816      1 Template:Icon_text\n 28.19%    7.748      2 Template:Trim\n 24.89%    6.843      1 Template:Ifempty\n 15.33%    4.214      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.24%    3.915      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.87%    3.539      1 Te